d1d10563a8fc8a5c94", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1e9aa2ef/uploads/origins/f2341af2-63ed-4784-ab9f-c78cf5139ea2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=94a47a66fdd99bd1d10563a8fc8a5c94, https://si.imgix.net/1e9aa2ef/uploads/origins/f2341af2-63ed-4784-ab9f-c78cf5139ea2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5a3d4b9db08f01b4bd4ebb934f1839f0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1e9aa2ef/uploads/origins/f2341af2-63ed-4784-ab9f-c78cf5139ea2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3e1989f954b423e64d092a0ffd25daa5 3x"}, "body": "Hello! I really like your style!\n\nMy character's concept is a computer program, who is trying his best to adopt 'human' habits / learn 'human' behaviors. He is usually neutral, so please draw him however you'd like! The artwork does not necessarily have to be heavily computer themed, it is up to you how to interpret the composition!\n\nIn the reference link, please refer to 'NEW DESIGN / 新しいデザイン' for his clothing - or, you can also dress him however you'd like - I'm okay with anything!\n\nI'll leave the pose and composition up to you, so please feel free to do what you'd like!\n\nThere are some references within the folder marked with '★' as well, I think these pieces convey his 'energy' well, so please refer to these for inspiration if you need it!\n\nSome important character details:\nEyeglasses (optional, but preferred)\nEar piercings\nBarcode tattoo on neck\nHis eye color is black\nHis haircut is an undercut, so it is very short in the back.\nHe has black fingernails.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1_nEs1-q9z-DWkInxlR3Q9u_Ar313nrEs?usp=drive_link", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@hariharipalette/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2489599, "client_id": 2424897, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c5bc85d6/uploads/origins/424c19d4-1ece-482d-91a8-b597d73452cc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2c008e49eec8f807484289860850a7db", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c5bc85d6/uploads/origins/424c19d4-1ece-482d-91a8-b597d73452cc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2c008e49eec8f807484289860850a7db, https://si.imgix.net/c5bc85d6/uploads/origins/424c19d4-1ece-482d-91a8-b597d73452cc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9ec949fc5245f00fabd6db5fd19a6610 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c5bc85d6/uploads/origins/424c19d4-1ece-482d-91a8-b597d73452cc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fdf80486b46fa756e10c3bcd96710822 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c5bc85d6/uploads/origins/424c19d4-1ece-482d-91a8-b597d73452cc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=8d82c900fd4c49efbd58de803e7eced3", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c5bc85d6/uploads/origins/424c19d4-1ece-482d-91a8-b597d73452cc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=8d82c900fd4c49efbd58de803e7eced3, https://si.imgix.net/c5bc85d6/uploads/origins/424c19d4-1ece-482d-91a8-b597d73452cc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d77ceac9554c3a7f7919811945425c80 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c5bc85d6/uploads/origins/424c19d4-1ece-482d-91a8-b597d73452cc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3023490f3ccea7fc35b6098564eb9e76 3x"}, "body": "こんにちは、\n\nあなたの作品が好きです！私のVtuber OCのソルを描いてもらえると嬉しいです。\n\nソルは熱血で、赤とオレンジの髪のイヌの宇宙軍人で、犬耳とふさふさの尻尾が特徴です。彼はサイバーパンク/SFの世界の出身です。エネルギッシュで、ちょっと間抜けで、楽しく笑うのが好き。どんなポーズ、表情、背景でもOK。ただ、新しい服が欲しい！参考までに、添付した私の過去の依頼の写真を見てください。\n\nありがとうございました！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/u/1/folders/17LFANSrO_HkFRXU_TnD-5RH2YiF7edmO", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@hariharipalette/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2489599, "client_id": 2432881, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/df350f48/uploads/origins/d8573cd9-74e9-4c4a-a931-d747d2bc2896?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c6750d4f2e2be83da15550345f1d7688", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/df350f48/uploads/origins/d8573cd9-74e9-4c4a-a931-d747d2bc2896?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c6750d4f2e2be83da15550345f1d7688, https://si.imgix.net/df350f48/uploads/origins/d8573cd9-74e9-4c4a-a931-d747d2bc2896?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c4020b4ea839e173f3b2fedfe15d8b47 2x, https://si.imgix.net/df350f48/uploads/origins/d8573cd9-74e9-4c4a-a931-d747d2bc2896?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=27f7611333e0f82505843ab0070049b5 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/df350f48/uploads/origins/d8573cd9-74e9-4c4a-a931-d747d2bc2896?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=96fc08e65173f3f4a5d3dbe6987078ed", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/df350f48/uploads/origins/d8573cd9-74e9-4c4a-a931-d747d2bc2896?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=96fc08e65173f3f4a5d3dbe6987078ed, https://si.imgix.net/df350f48/uploads/origins/d8573cd9-74e9-4c4a-a931-d747d2bc2896?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=088f49fbde5162db94405170b13c192a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/df350f48/uploads/origins/d8573cd9-74e9-4c4a-a931-d747d2bc2896?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=84c9d80d3fa9824613bd5238e82b7594 3x"}, "body": "こんにちは！あなたの作品はとてもクールで、私のキャラクター \"Halcyon \"の作品をお願いしたいです。\n\n彼は高位の魔道士の間に生まれたダンピールで、その血を通して魔法と強いつながりを持っています。頭を上げ、穏やかな笑顔で挨拶し、はにかみながらも大人びた態度をとる。優しそうな表情を浮かべているが、人々の後継者としてふさわしいと思われるためには手段を選ばない不吉な一面もある。\n\nデザインノート\n- 彼の目は虹色で、外側に緑色のリングがある。\n- そばかすがある。\n- 彼の髪は毛先が明るい茶色にオンブレされている。\n\n私はあなたに創造的な自由を与えます。\n\nありがとうございました！\n\nhttps://toyhou.se/27029315.halcyon/gallery?key=hD7v1DD13V4vFqx#81324252", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@hariharipalette/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2489599, "client_id": 3701496, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/795e2133/uploads/origins/4871de41-4e08-4e32-bf00-85165a81ea01?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=29d1dc09b145168171965734f39a9256", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/795e2133/uploads/origins/4871de41-4e08-4e32-bf00-85165a81ea01?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=29d1dc09b145168171965734f39a9256, https://si.imgix.net/795e2133/uploads/origins/4871de41-4e08-4e32-bf00-85165a81ea01?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b28d90b9c7b0a7d8d89e93974fbc90ca 2x, https://si.imgix.net/795e2133/uploads/origins/4871de41-4e08-4e32-bf00-85165a81ea01?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=86bdf1e4472a6efa1d25d2d6a4547230 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/795e2133/uploads/origins/4871de41-4e08-4e32-bf00-85165a81ea01?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d982ebbc9e1c2ac8b43242ff7682b864", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/795e2133/uploads/origins/4871de41-4e08-4e32-bf00-85165a81ea01?bg=%23fff&a